  deployHint: 'Your AI tool fixes what it found. Or say "accept" and the number (or "accept all") to go on without fixing one, "go live without the scan" to put just this version live as it is, or "quality scan off" to stop the scan for good.',
  deployRunNow: 'Your AI tool runs the scan now. To put just this version live without it, say "go live without the scan". To switch the scan off for good, say "quality scan off".',
  // For the AI in a tool without the Piezas checks (nothing records the
  // owner's chat reply): it relays their exact words (Spec Part 2, #51).
  relayForAI: 'If this AI tool has no Piezas checks, relay the owner\'s exact words: `npx piezas quality-scan accept <number> --owner-reply "<their words>"` (also skip, off, before-publishing); the record says it was relayed.',
  nothingToAccept: 'There is nothing to accept: no quality scan result is waiting.',
  stillOpen: (n) => `Quality scan: ${things(n)} still open:`,
